docs {
  # AnnouncementService.GetPublicAnnouncement

  One public announcement by its 18-character slug; internal or unknown ones are NOT_FOUND

  `/ltedu.announcements.v1.AnnouncementService/GetPublicAnnouncement` · unary · `ltedu/announcements/v1/announcements.proto`

  ## Request — `GetPublicAnnouncementRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `slug` | `string` |  |

  ## Response — `GetPublicAnnouncementResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `announcement` | `Announcement` |  |

  ## Tipos

  ### `Announcement`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `id` | `string` |  |
  | `slug` | `string` | 18 characters of [a-z0-9] |
  | `kind` | `string` | announcement \| notice \| alert |
  | `audience` | `string` | community \| students \| guardians \| staff |
  | `title` | `string` |  |
  | `body` | `string` |  |
  | `is_public` | `bool` |  |
  | `pinned` | `bool` |  |
  | `author_name` | `string` |  |
  | `published_at` | `Timestamp` |  |
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `attachments` | `repeated Attachment` | In order; the first image is the cover |
  | `featured_from` | `optional Timestamp` | Validity window of the home modal (unset: not featured) |
  | `featured_until` | `optional Timestamp` |  |
  | `cta_label` | `string` | Ir \| Continuar (empty when not featured) |
  | `cta_url` | `string` | Where the button leads: a site path or an https address; empty means the announcement's own page |
  | `updated_at` | `Timestamp` |  |

  ### `Attachment`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `id` | `string` |  |
  | `kind` | `string` | image \| document |
  | `file_name` | `string` |  |
  | `content_type` | `string` |  |
  | `size_bytes` | `int64` |  |
  | `position` | `int32` |  |

  Errores: status gRPC con un `ltedu.common.v1.ErrorDetail` (code, message, fields) en los details.
